# Build context allowlist: only what the multi-stage Dockerfile needs
# (Cargo workspace, crates, embedded deploy/ manifests, and the UI sources).
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!deploy/
!ui/

# Never ship local build output, dependencies, or secrets into the context.
**/target/
**/node_modules/
ui/dist/
ui/coverage/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
deploy/bootstrap/*/Pulumi.stage0-*.yaml
deploy/bootstrap/*/*-config
